{
    "id":  11057,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "SPI C6 Remote Control - for Digital SPI LED Controller RGB - RGBW - RGBIC - (2.4GHz)",
    "reference":  "92111-C6",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSPI C6 Remote Control,\u003c/strong\u003e Designed for digital SPI LED controllers \u003cstrong\u003eRGB, RGBW and RGBIC\u003c/strong\u003e, this RF remote control (2.4GHz) allows you to easily adjust color, width editing, and select dynamic modes. Enjoy fast, stable transmission thanks to 2.4G wireless technology with anti-interference capability. Control multiple devices simultaneously and customize your lighting. With a control range of up to 30 meters, \u003cstrong\u003eits magnetic installation is simple and quick.\u003c/strong\u003e Ideal for creating atmospheres in commercial or residential applications, this remote is your perfect ally for advanced and customizable lighting!\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eSPI C6 Remote Control - for Digital SPI LED Controller RGB - RGBW - RGBIC - (2.4GHz)\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eElevate your lighting experience with the SPI C6 Remote Control, essential for any LED lighting enthusiast. RF 2.4GHz remote compatible with digital SPI LED controllers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features:\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWide Compatibility:\u003c/strong\u003e Works with RGB, RGBW, and RGBIC digital SPI LED controllers.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFull Color and Brightness Control:\u003c/strong\u003e Easily adjust color, brightness, and LED strip length.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDynamic Modes and Customizable Effects:\u003c/strong\u003e Multiple dynamic modes and effects, adjustable speed.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdvanced Wireless 2.4G Technology:\u003c/strong\u003e Fast stable transmission with anti-interference.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExtended Control Range:\u003c/strong\u003e Up to 30 meters.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMagnetic Installation:\u003c/strong\u003e Easy magnetic support, quick setup.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eApplications:\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLiving rooms, bedrooms, offices, shops, restaurants. Handles multiple devices simultaneously.\u003c/p\u003e",
